div
	p per; [i The Subhelion Trust      ] is an Employee Ownership Trust (EOT) that owns and operates the [i Corporation] in conjunction with the [i Foundation] for the benefit of its artists, authors, and workers.
	p pub; [i The Subhelion Foundation ] is a non-profit organization dedicated to creating a new future with cooperative business, structured community, and ethical technology. It accomplishes its mission by giving material and organizational support to [a; the precarious] and their champions.
	p pri; [i The Subhelion Corporation] is a for-profit production company for educational and entertainment media.
end

